                  "id": "XHSDn",
                  "name": "auHint",
                  "fill": "#8A8A8A",
                  "content": "审计日志为只读，任何角色都不可修改或删除；规则/名单变更必须记录 before/after 快照（E16）。",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "OjO6j",
