                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "hxGUs",
                  "name": "auNoteTitle",
                  "fill": "#222222",
                  "content": "关键需求标注",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "9Va9l",
                  "name": "auNoteWrap",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "fill": "#F7F7F7",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "padding": 16,
                  "gap": 10,
                  "cornerRadius": 6,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "FDFK5",
                      "name": "auNote0",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "1. 哈希链采用单写者串行化写入，避免并发分叉（AD-04 / 悬空点 G-10）。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "kCdBY",
                      "name": "auNote1",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "2. 「执行全链校验」是本系统『不可篡改审计』验收点的直接证据，必须真实重算而非返回固定值。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "hMddf",
                      "name": "auNote2",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "3. 支持按操作人 / 动作类型 / 目标类型 / 时间范围四维筛选。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "LWXti",
                      "name": "auNote3",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "4. 审计日志保留策略为永久，不参与 TTL 清理。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "7rVSS",
                      "name": "auNote4",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "5. 变更摘要需可展开查看完整 before/after JSON 对比。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
